-- Studio Maçon: rewritten product copy
-- no em dashes; boilerplate lives in NOTES
begin;
update public.store_products set description='There was a cast iron piggy bank in Hannah''s grandfather''s house, and Pip came out of remembering it rather than looking at it. He is heavier than he looks, and the patina darkens where your thumb sits, so after a year you can see how you have been holding him. Each one is made by hand.' where slug='pip';
update public.store_products set description='The first one we made, with the silhouette left unresolved on purpose: a hare from some angles, something else from others. People tend to find their own animal in it, and we have worked that way ever since. Each one is made by hand.' where slug='rebi';
update public.store_products set description='Part red painted horse from a Swedish shelf, part the little wooden mare who comes alive and carries the girl into the woods, a book Hannah had as a child. The mane is finished bright and the body left to darken, so two ages of bronze sit on the same animal. Each one is made by hand.' where slug='ren';
update public.store_products set description='Zuma and the ring were drawn in one sitting, so the ring looks taken from the totem rather than made to match it. Small enough for a coat pocket, which is where they tend to end up. Each one is made by hand.' where slug='zuma';
update public.store_products set description='Ori began as a commission for a friend who loves bears, and she let us keep making him. Nothing about him is explicitly bear, no claws, barely a snout, and people know anyway. Each one is made by hand.' where slug='ori';
update public.store_products set description='Yaël is Hannah''s other name, and it means ibex. We had been drawing them long before there was a reason to. Each one is made by hand.' where slug='yael';
update public.store_products set description='We drew the mark before we made anything, then wanted a piece that felt like it, and Milo is that piece. The name arrived later, from an island. Each one is made by hand.' where slug='milo';
update public.store_products set description='We love this one, though it rarely sells, so it is cast only when someone asks. If that is you, tell us. Each one is made by hand.' where slug='eleph';
update public.store_products set description='A watcher, cast on request. We have photographed Ibi many times and never once gotten a picture that looks like holding it. Each one is made by hand.' where slug='ibi';
update public.store_products set description='Drawn beside the totem it is named for, with the band repeating the animal''s shoulder line. Sterling silver, and it warms quickly. Each one is made by hand.' where slug='zuma-ring';
update public.store_products set description='Two ellipses, not quite matching, held at the distance where they stop competing. We were thinking about our own marriage, and it took a long time for a shape this plain. Each one is made by hand.' where slug='eclipse-ring';
update public.store_products set description='Shelter cut into rock, deep in the desert, where the water is kept and nobody outside is told. The aperture is the point of it, and you end up looking through. Sterling silver. Each one is made by hand.' where slug='sietch-aperture';
update public.store_products set description='On our honeymoon we spent a day inside a canyon of white folded rock that looked more like the moon than anywhere on earth should. This ring came out of that day, and so did most of the first collection. Each one is made by hand.' where slug='lunar-canyon-ring';
update public.store_products set description='The second half of that honeymoon we walked the rim of a caldera, the drop on one side the whole way, and the cuff holds that curve. No piercing, it grips, warms, and then you forget it. Each one is made by hand.' where slug='ear-cuff';
update public.store_products set description='Ida played hers until the goblins danced out the window, a story Hannah has known since she was small. Sterling silver on a thirty inch chain. Each one is made by hand.' where slug='wonderhorn-talisman';
update public.store_products set description='There is a royal starship, chrome and unarmed, that we have both been thinking about for twenty years, ancient and futuristic in the same hull. This is as close as we have come. Sterling silver, thirty inch chain. Each one is made by hand.' where slug='starshipkey-pendant';
update public.store_products set description='Everyone who picks this up mentions the weight, and it is heavier than it looks. Sterling silver, sized to the finger. Each one is made by hand.' where slug='meridian-egg-ring';
update public.store_products set description='We made these because we each wanted one, with our mark on the front and some protection from the sun.' where slug='macon-cap';
commit;
